        "chapterId": "HAG.1",
        "content": "Bw’ati bw’ayogera Mukama ow’eggye nti, “Abantu bano boogera nti, ‘Ekiseera tekinnatuuka okuddaabiriza ennyumba ya Mukama.’ ”",
        "reference": "Kaggayi 1:2",
        "verseNumber": "2",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
