        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.1",
        "content": "Nasindika ekyeya ku nnimiro ne ku nsozi, ku mmere ey’empeke ne ku wayini omuggya, ku mafuta ne ku buli bibala eby’ettaka, ku bantu ne ku nsolo, ne ku mirimu gyonna egy’engalo.”",
        "reference": "Kaggayi 1:11",
        "verseNumber": "11",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/HAG/HAG.1.mp3"
    },
    {
