            "book": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3cf48"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.1",
        "content": "Awo Zerubbaberi mutabani wa Seyalutyeri, ne Yoswa mutabani wa Yekozadaaki, ye yali kabona asinga obukulu, n’abantu bonna abaasigalawo ne bagondera eddoboozi lya Mukama Katonda waabwe, n’obubaka bwa nnabbi Kaggayi, kubanga Mukama Katonda waabwe ye yamutuma. Abantu ne batya Mukama.",
        "reference": "Kaggayi 1:12",
        "verseNumber": "12",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/HAG/HAG.1.mp3"
