            "book": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3cf48"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.2",
        "content": "‘Ekitiibwa eky’ennyumba eriwo kaakano, kirisinga ekitiibwa ky’eri eyasooka era mu kifo kino ndizzaawo emirembe,’ bw’ayogera Mukama ow’Eggye.”",
        "reference": "Kaggayi 2:9",
        "verseNumber": "9",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/HAG/HAG.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a697e4909dcafd49c4f",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "HAG.2.10",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3cfd6",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3cf48"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.2",
        "content": "Awo ku lunaku olw’amakumi abiri mu ennya olw’omwezi ogw’omwenda mu mwaka ogwokubiri ogw’okufuga kwa Daliyo, ekigambo kya Mukama ne kijjira nnabbi Kaggayi nti,",
        "reference": "Kaggayi 2:10",
        "verseNumber": "10",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/HAG/HAG.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a697e4909dcafd49cee",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "HAG.2.11",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3cfd6",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3cf48"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.2",
        "content": "“Bw’atyo bw’ayogera Mukama ow’Eggye nti, ‘Buuza bakabona etteeka kye ligamba.",
        "reference": "Kaggayi 2:11",
        "verseNumber": "11",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/HAG/HAG.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a697e4909dcafd49d37",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "HAG.2.12",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3cfd6",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3cf48"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.2",
        "content": "Omuntu bw’asitulira ennyama eyatukuzibwa mu kirenge eky’ekyambalo kye, ekirenge ne kikoma ku mugaati oba ku supu, oba ku wayini, oba ku mafuta oba ku mmere endala yonna, bitukuzibwa?’ ”\n    Bakabona ne baddamu nti, “Nedda.”",
        "reference": "Kaggayi 2:12",
        "verseNumber": "12",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/HAG/HAG.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a6a7e4909dcafd49d64",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "HAG.2.13",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3cfd6",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3cf48"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.2",
        "content": "Awo Kaggayi n’abuuza nti, “Omuntu atali mulongoofu olw’omulambo, bw’akoma ku bintu ebyo, bifuuka ebitali birongoofu?”\n    Bakabona ne baddamu nti, “Bifuuka ebitali birongoofu.”",
        "reference": "Kaggayi 2:13",
        "verseNumber": "13",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/HAG/HAG.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a6a7e4909dcafd49de3",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "HAG.2.14",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3cfd6",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3cf48"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.2",
        "content": "Kaggayi n’addamu nti, “Kale nno bwe batyo bwe bali abantu bano n’eggwanga lino. Buli kye bakola ne buli kye bawaayo ng’ekiweebwayo, si kirongoofu,” bw’ayogera Mukama.",
        "reference": "Kaggayi 2:14",
        "verseNumber": "14",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/HAG/HAG.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a6a7e4909dcafd49e42",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "HAG.2.15",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3cfd6",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3cf48"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.2",
        "content": "“ ‘Kale nno, mweddeko okuva ku lunaku lwa leero, mujjukire ebiseera biri bwe byali, nga n’ejjinja erimu terinnateekebwa ku linnaalyo mu yeekaalu ya Mukama.",
        "reference": "Kaggayi 2:15",
        "verseNumber": "15",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/HAG/HAG.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a6a7e4909dcafd49e89",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "HAG.2.16",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3cfd6",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3cf48"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.2",
        "content": "Omuntu yenna bwe yatuukanga ku ntuumu eyandibadde ey’ebipimo amakumi abiri, yassangawo ebipimo kkumi. Omuntu yenna bwe yalaganga mu ssogolero okusenamu lita amakumi ataano, yasangangamu amakumi abiri.",
        "reference": "Kaggayi 2:16",
        "verseNumber": "16",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/HAG/HAG.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a6a7e4909dcafd49efd",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "HAG.2.17",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3cfd6",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3cf48"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.2",
        "content": "Nakolimira emirimu gyonna egy’emikono gyammwe n’okugengewala n’obukuku, n’omuzira, naye ne mutakyuka kudda gye ndi,’ bw’ayogera Mukama.",
        "reference": "Kaggayi 2:17",
        "verseNumber": "17",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/HAG/HAG.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a6a7e4909dcafd49f68",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "HAG.2.18",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3cfd6",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3cf48"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.2",
        "content": "Okuva olunaku lwa leero, olw’amakumi abiri mu ennya mu mwezi ogw’omwenda, mujjukire olunaku lwe baazimba omusingi gwa yeekaalu ya Mukama. Mwebuuze nti,",
        "reference": "Kaggayi 2:18",
        "verseNumber": "18",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/HAG/HAG.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a6a7e4909dcafd49fb1",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "HAG.2.19",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3cfd6",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3cf48"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.2",
        "content": "Wakyaliwo ensigo eyasigala mu tterekero? Mulabe, emiti gino egimenyeddwa, ogw’omuzabbibu n’ogw’omutiini, n’ogw’omukomamawanga, n’ogw’omuzeeyituuni tegibalangako bibala.\n    “ ‘Naye okuva ne leero ndibawa omukisa.’ ”",
        "reference": "Kaggayi 2:19",
        "verseNumber": "19",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/HAG/HAG.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a6a7e4909dcafd49ffb",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "HAG.2.20",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3cfd6",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3cf48"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.2",
        "content": "Awo ekigambo kya Mukama ne kijjira Kaggayi omulundi ogwokubiri ku lunaku olw’amakumi abiri mu ennya olw’omwezi ogwo nga kigamba nti,",
        "reference": "Kaggayi 2:20",
        "verseNumber": "20",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/HAG/HAG.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a6b7e4909dcafd4a0a4",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "HAG.2.21",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3cfd6",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3cf48"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.2",
        "content": "“Tegeeza Zerubbaberi gavana wa Yuda nti ndikankanya eggulu n’ensi.",
        "reference": "Kaggayi 2:21",
        "verseNumber": "21",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/HAG/HAG.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a6b7e4909dcafd4a0f4",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "HAG.2.22",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3cfd6",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3cf48"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.2",
        "content": "Ndisulika entebe ez’obwakabaka ne nzigyawo obuyinza bw’obwakabaka obunnaggwanga. Ndiwamba amagaali n’abavuzi baago, n’embalaasi na buli abazeebagala, balittibwa baganda baabwe.",
        "reference": "Kaggayi 2:22",
        "verseNumber": "22",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/HAG/HAG.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a6b7e4909dcafd4a153",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "HAG.2.23",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3cfd6",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
